WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.980
Ms. Kirisu!

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.980
How about going to one more bar?

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.610
Let's have a passionate exchange
about education!

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.440
No, I've had enough.
I'm going home.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.580
Ms. Kirisu is so mysterious!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.460
I wonder if she's got a boyfriend.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.750
I image that in her private life...

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.130
BEAUTIFUL APARTMENT

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.050
ELEGANT LOUNGEWEAR

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.930
EXPENSIVE-LOOKING
PINOT NOIR

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.390
It must be like that!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.440
It has to be!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:51.570
<i>Fatigued. I'm just not cut out
for that kind of scene.</i>

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.200
<i>I just want to get home
and slip into sweats.</i>

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.240
And that's how I started
with those white radish roots.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:56.950
<i>Yuiga?</i>

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.280
Pretty impressive, kid.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.620
MAID CAFE

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.160
And now it's grown into radishes.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.080
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.170
Ms. Kirisu!
What are you doing here?!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.260
That's my line!

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:16.130
Are you trying to blow up
that recommendation, Yuiga?

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:18.180
A high school student downtown...

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.930
And being overly familiar
with this suspicious shop!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:21.970
It's outrageous!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:22.890
Huh?

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:26.690
It is you!
My old teacher, Ms. Mafuyu!

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.230
I haven't seen you since graduation.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.980
K-Kominami?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:10.250
EPISODE 11:
AN ILLUSTRIOUS VETERAN
SOMETIMES SERVES X

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.790
I never thought I'd see you
in my cafe, Ms. Mafuyu.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.460
What is this world coming to?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.510
Unauthorized. I've told you
many times not to call me "Ms. Mafuyu."

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:25.260
<i>I see. Since she's an alumni,
no surprise she'd know Ms. Kirisu.</i>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:30.180
That aside, Kominami,
why are you working at a seedy place like—

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.900
I've already graduated,
so no more lectures, please!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.650
Besides...

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.070
as you can see, the only thing
Junior's hitting here is the books!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.200
So you can leave here
with peace of mind, teacher.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.250
Nonsense! There's no way
he can concentrate in a shop like this!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.120
You're coming home with me, Yuiga!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.080
L-Let go of him, Kominami!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.250
You let go of him!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.670
<i>What the heck is going on here?</i>

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.010
What, are you jealous
of your student's girlfriend?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.180
Th-That's a ridiculous thing to say!

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.110
WAITING ROOM

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.820
I'm sorry. I was careless.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.240
How can I make it up to you?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.620
I-It's okay. This is nothing.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.490
Look.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.910
You should try to stay off of it.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.590
It was my fault too.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.380
Take a little time off, Machiko.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:43.170
But without me,
you'll be short-handed at the cafe.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.550
You guys won't be able to manage.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.910
Y-You're really doing this,
Ms. Kirisu?

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.000
I-I have no choice.
It's my responsibility.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.340
But don't look at me too much.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.470
All right, why don't we start
with practicing greetings...

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:26.970
Mafuyu?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.260
Mafuyu?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.600
It would be strange to call you
"Ms. Kirisu" here, wouldn't it?

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.890
So please practice greeting your master.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.350
There's your training partner.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.570
Um, Ms. Kirisu,
maybe this isn't such a good idea.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.950
K-Keep quiet, Yuiga!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.750
W-Welcome home. Master.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.130
<i>Humiliating! So humiliating!</i>

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.640
<i>Th-This is bad! I feel like
something is awakening inside of me!</i>

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.890
Well, I'm going to have you
working behind the scenes today,

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.640
so you don't really need
to do greetings.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.980
Why did you make her do it then?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:25.230
It's Mafuyu's first day, so I wouldn't
make her interact with customers.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.990
I'm not an ogre.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.110
As long as she does the basics
of a maid's work,

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.660
cleaning the shop
and washing dishes, I'll be satisfied.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.080
<i>Checkmate!</i>

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.330
Easy. I can do that.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.380
<i>Where is that confidence coming from?!</i>

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.920
You don't have to worry
on my account, Yuiga.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.680
At my apartment is one thing,
at work another.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.050
I can clean as well as any average person.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.640
<i>Oh. So if Ms. Kirisu puts her mind to it,
she can clean then.</i>

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.240
Mortifying.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.620
<i>Why would she try to put on airs?</i>

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:24.380
S-Sorry! I'll get that cleaned up
right away, so please don't blame her!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.210
Perfect!

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.880
A clumsy maid is just what we needed!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.640
Are you okay?

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.890
Hey, are you hurt?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.430
I'll help over here.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.640
You two,
please take care of the customers.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.270
Thank you!
We owe you, Yuiga!

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.980
I'm counting on you, Junior!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.070
Y-You don't have to do that!
It's my mess and I can clean it myself!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.620
What are you talking about?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:01.040
When someone messes up,
we should help each other fix it.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:05.080
Because there aren't too many people
who can do everything.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.460
So let's clean this up.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.880
<i>Thank you!
We owe you, Yuiga!</i>

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.390
<i>I'm counting on you, Junior!</i>

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.810
<i>Yuiga is always serious about helping us!</i>

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.770
<i>It was my fault!</i>

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.850
<i>Ms. Kirisu, it's a misunderstanding!</i>

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.820
<i>What an unusual boy.</i>

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:32.570
<i>Yuiga, wherever you go...</i>

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.330
Cheers! Good work!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:56.050
I feel like I did nothing but screw up,
from beginning to end.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.800
Not at all!
Really, you were a big help.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.390
I never knew my old teacher
had a weakness.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.190
Kominami,
do you still want to be a doctor?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.480
Of course, that's my goal.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:13.440
Whether you're against it or not,
I'm not changing my mind.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.700
Oh?

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:22.370
Was Ms. Kirisu opposed
to the idea when you were a student?

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:26.620
Yeah, well... All my grades
were decent except for science,

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:31.340
so she told me it was
a waste of time to aim to be a doctor.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.590
<i>I can see that.</i>

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:38.470
Still, thanks to Ms. Mafuyu
being against it to the end,

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.810
I've been able to do my best
through a sense of "I'll show her!"

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.390
To achieve something
you're not suited for,

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:51.070
you need a rebellious spirit
that can break through a huge wall.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:56.610
Whatever you do,
she'll never praise you and she'd never say it,

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:01.160
but I have a feeling
she's the one who taught me that.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.540
Oh, by the way, Yuiga...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.540
Y-Yes?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.460
About you hanging out at this place...

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.510
Just be sure you leave no later than 9 p.m.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.510
If you can't abide by that,
we'll have a meeting in my office.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.060
Understood! Thank you!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.350
Ms. Kirisu!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.810
Is this liquor?

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:34.610
You're an adult,
so I thought that's what you'd prefer!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.530
<i>How drunk can you get on one sip?</i>

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.710
Are you okay, Ms. Kirisu?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.580
We're almost at your apartment.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:58.050
<i>I wonder why she suddenly
decided to let me keep going there.</i>

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:06.720
Good boy. It's admirable
how hard you always work, Yuiga.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.060
Hey, Ms. Kirisu!
You're a little too drunk!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:19.030
Yuiga, wherever you go,
you help people and gain their trust.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.030
That really is amazing.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:28.040
Kominami, Ogata,
Furuhashi, Takemoto too.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.960
You all always give 100%.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.380
Ms. Kirisu just complimented all of us.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:44.220
And also, you do such a good job
of wearing glasses every day.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.640
And it's great
how you can walk so steadily!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.980
And wonderful
how you can eat all by yourself!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.860
You're so good at breathing, Yuiga!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.740
<i>It's just that when she gets drunk,
she praises everything!</i>

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:07.990
<i>I... I can't remember anything...</i>

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:07.990
THE NEXT MORNING

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.320
Predicament.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:45.570
DRY CLEANING TAG

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.570
<i>All of my suits are at the cleaners.</i>

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:51.080
<i>And I forgot that I got carried away
and washed all my sweats.</i>

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.460
<i>Fail.</i>

00:12:54.210 --> 00:13:01.880
<i>I have to go to the school today to pick up
documents, so is there something I can wear?</i>

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.590
<i>Oh, I couldn't.</i>

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.600
<i>But it's all I've got.</i>

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:17.560
<i>If anyone I know sees me in this,
it's all over.</i>

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.030
<i>But at least it's summer break.</i>

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.200
<i>If I take my car there,
I can be in and out in a minute.</i>

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:36.250
<i>Surprisingly enough,
I think I still look pretty good in this.</i>

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.460
Are you a high school student?

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.880
You look like an adult to me,
but let me see your license.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.680
<i>Fail.</i>

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.390
Huh? You're an adult.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.140
Wearing that outfit at your age...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:14:00.310
You wouldn't be involved
in anything sketchy now, would you?

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:03.280
Would you do me a favor and explain this?

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.030
<i>Fail, fail, fail, fail, fail!</i>

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.320
Huh? Ms. Kirisu!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.070
Is there a problem?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.700
<i>It's over.</i>

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.830
You know her?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.750
Yes, she's a teacher at my school.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.960
And the drama club advisor.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:25.840
Actually, for practice today,
we're having her play the role of a student.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.300
Oh, is that what it is?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.970
You should be more careful
not to give the wrong idea.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.470
Yes, we certainly will.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.310
So...

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.190
Wrong! Whatever you're thinking,
you have the wrong idea!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.150
Yuiga, I have a perfectly
reasonable explanation for this.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.320
I suspect all of your laundry
is drying on the line,

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.530
so you had nothing else to wear.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:57.370
It's actually more humiliating
that you can read me like a book.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.540
Sorry for bumming a ride.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:07.260
You're going to return books
at the school library, right?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.180
Since we're both going to school,
giving you a lift makes sense.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.430
Hold on tight.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:24.230
M-Ms. Kirisu, aren't you going
a little too fast?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.480
Really?
I'm staying within the speed limit.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.240
Are you sure?

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:31.200
No problem.
Don't worry, Yuiga.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.240
This is where it gets really fun.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.620
<i>She should not be behind the wheel!</i>

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.960
Let me out!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.300
FACULTY ROOM

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.970
Got it.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.770
I retrieved the documents
without being seen.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.650
Now I just have to make a quick getaway.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.900
<i>I-I think I'm going to throw up.</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.360
The shortcut to the parking lot is...

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.570
The volleyball team
is practicing right over there!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:15.490
There are a lot of students here for club
activities, so let's proceed with caution.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.370
R-Right.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.620
There's the Basketball Club!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.210
The Tennis Club!

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.210
Hiking Club!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.130
FACULTY PARKING LOT

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.510
You were a big help, Yuiga.
You sure you don't want a ride home?

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:37.720
No. I really want nothing
more than to walk home, but thanks.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.850
Well, I'll make it up to you sometime.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:48.110
No way.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.030
I'm out of gas.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.380
<i>She's so close.</i>

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:12.420
Um, what were you like
in high school, Ms. Kirisu?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.800
What?
That came out of the blue.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.760
Well, it crossed my mind
seeing you in that outfit.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.810
Figure skating was always first,

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:29.690
so I hardly have memories of stopping
somewhere on the way home from school.

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:35.070
Ms. Kirisu,
would you wait here a minute?

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.050
What are you doing?

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:04.140
It's against school rules
to buy sweets on the way home.

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:07.310
Well, it's summer break.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:08.770
Sheesh.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.320
So how much was it?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.900
No, that's okay.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.450
I've made a little money
from helping out at the maid cafe.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.450
It's not okay! What kind
of teacher lets a student pay for her?

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:27.080
Um, but now it's, you know...

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:32.210
Like a student treating
his friend from the same school.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.050
Friend?

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.800
Sorry. I stepped over the line there.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.270
But, thank y—

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.110
Ri, this is it!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.400
This is the ice cream stand
everyone talks about?

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.740
There's nothing better
than sweets to combat study fatigue!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.870
Is something wrong, Fumino?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.500
No. I just heard a sound.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.580
I-I think we're in the clear.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.080
Now we just have to stay
like this for a few more seconds.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.170
Oof.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.710
<i>What?</i>

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.300
Delicious.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.340
I know, right?

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:24.510
I-It looks like they're not
going to leave for a while!

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:28.270
No problem! We just have
to clear out, calmly and quietly.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:36.780
U-Um, Ms. Kirisu.
I think we're a little too close together.

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:39.030
U-Unavoidable.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.280
It's kind of tough to hold this position.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.910
If we move now, they'll notice us.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:49.160
All we can do is wait until they leave.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.540
Something's there!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.250
Is it a ghost?

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.920
No good!
We can't hide anymore! It's over!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.550
For both of us!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.260
Um. Is someone back...

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.680
...there?

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.900
L-Let's go, Ri!

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:15.730
W-Was it a ghost after all?

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.360
Something even worse!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.900
Like a monster?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:24.160
<i>It was too dark to see their faces,
but they were wearing our school uniform!</i>

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.990
That was the first kissing scene
I've seen in real life!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.160
Fumino! W-Wait up!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.840
I-It looks like they left.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.630
S-Sorry! It was a spur of the moment, but...

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.800
But it was the only thing
I could think of!

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.300
I know.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:51.020
The fact is, your quick thinking
saved us, so I don't mind.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.140
Come on, let's go.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.650
<i>My heart won't stop pounding.</i>

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.990
<i>Of course,
Ms. Kirisu is an adult about it.</i>

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.990
<i>She's as calm as ever.</i>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.930
How can I put this?
What a lousy day, huh?

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:52.680
Yes. I owe you an apology
for putting you through all that, Yuiga.

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:59.060
I wonder what Furuhashi thought
when she saw us.

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:07.150
With the uniforms,
maybe she thought we were sweethearts.

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:10.700
Never mind.
Forget it.

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:11.910
See you.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:26.090
So you're seriously
into school uniform cosplay, Ms. Mafuyu?

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:29.130
Even I don't have the guts to do that.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:30.220
I'm going to die.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:33.140
Don't do anything rash!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time: Sometimes a Genius
Travels Down Memory Lane with X.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.020
NEXT EPISODE: SOMETIMES A GENIUS
TRAVELS DOWN
MEMORY LANE WITH X
